{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52909","headline":"别匡山 · 李白","name":"别匡山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓峰如画碧参差（碑作「参差碧」），藤影风摇拂槛垂。\n野径来多将犬伴，人间归晚带（碑作「待」）樵随。\n看云客倚啼猿树，洗鉢僧临失鹤（一作「鹭」，或作「鹜」）池。\n莫怪无心恋清境，已将书剑许明时。\n（见光绪《重修江油县志》卷二十四）（陈广福《李白的〈别匡山〉诗考》谓江油县匡山书院存宋熙宁元年《勅赐中和大明寺住持碑》，碑文云：「玄宗朝翰林学士李白字太白，少爲当县小吏，後於此山读书，於乔松滴翠之平有十载。\n」文中录此诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52909.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52909","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}